# CLI-entrypoints: geen `vsa mvsa`

**Nooit** `vsa mvsa …` — dat bestaat niet.

| Bron    | Commando (console-script)                                   |
| ------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| `.mvsa` | `mvsa validate` / `mvsa mxl` / `mvsa mscz` / `mvsa pdf` / … |
| `.mscz` | `mscz …`                                                    |
| `.mxl`  | `mxl …`                                                     |
| `.vsa`  | `vsa validate` / `vsa svg` / `vsa musicxml` / …             |

Translit (productbesluiten: `docs/plans/kerkslavisch-transliteratie.md` §5a):

```cmd
mvsa mxl pad\lied.mvsa --translit
mvsa mxl pad\lied.mvsa --translit-as-parts
mvsa mscz pad\lied.mvsa --translit
mvsa pdf pad\lied.mvsa --translit
mvsa svg pad\lied.mvsa --translit
```

`--translit-as-parts` alleen op `mvsa mxl` (Coria). Sibling-uitvoer: `lied.mvsa.mxl`, enz.
